        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Inox XSE345MC70, Tokyo Lever with Square Rose and Mortise</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a mortise leverset made by Inox. The Tokyo Mortise Lockset is available in several functions. It will fit standard doors with 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-3/4 inches thick. The Tokyo Lever with Square Rose and Mortise is made out of stainless steel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the XSE Tokyo Mortise Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hardened knurled brass nut.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty wire torsion spring.</li>\r\n<li>Threaded rose cover for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Solid Stainless Steel lever, cast Stainless Steel sub-rose.</li>\r\n<li>Passed 1 million cycle testing.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.13 Grade 1 Mortise Locks</li>\r\n<li>UL listed for 3-hour fire door.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Stainless Steel Tokyo Leverset with Mortise:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-9/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Case Size: 4\" x 6-7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Front: 1-1/4\" x 8\" x 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Lever to Cylinder: 3-7/8\" (98mm)</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 3/4\" (19mm) anti-friction throw</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Schlage C keyway</li>\r\n<li>Lever Spindle 8mm x 8mm square</li>\r\n<li>Strike: ANSI stainless steel strike, 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\"curved, field reversible</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> for Inox X Series Mortise Lever Sets:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Passage (ANSI: F01):</b> Outside and inside lever are always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (ANSI: F22):</b> Inside thumb-turn locks and unlocks outside lever. Outside release button with slot for emergency unlock from outside. Inside lever is always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom (ANSI: F07):</b> Key from outside locks and unlocks latchbolt. Outside lever is always inactive. No thumb-turn inside. Inside lever allows emergency egress.</li>\r\n<li><b>Classroom (ANSI: F05):</b>Key from outside locks and unlocks outside lever to operate latchbolt. No thumb-turn inside. Inside lever allows emergency egress.</li>\r\n<li><b>Office (ANSI: F04):</b> Key outside, thumb-turn inside. Outside lever free-wheel when latchbolt is locked. No deadbolt. Inside lever allows emergency egress. Built -in toggle function.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
